
When you unzip the files, please use the "conserve directory structure"
option. This is usually the "-d" switch on unzip programs. If you are
using PKUnzip on the PC, you'd type:

PKUnzip -d DPBankXX

Since version 1.3, the files have been split up as:
-DPBANKxx.ZIP The program and english files
-DPBxx_DE.ZIP The program and german files
-DPBxx_FR.ZIP The program and french files
-DPBxx_NO.ZIP The program and norwegian files
(xx represents the program version). You should be able to find all the
files from the same source you got this one from. If you are having
troubles, always start looking on my homepage for the latest versions,
news, bug reports, etc.

